            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.19

- Turns incomplete Checkup rows into clear, actionable next steps.
- Places shortcut testing directly beside the shortcut check and explains what to press.
- Removes the disconnected settings-button footer and keeps only a compact refresh action.
]]></description>
