        <item>
            <title>0.6.17</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 23:16:42 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.17</link>
            <sparkle:version>50</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.17</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.17

- Replaces the vague “Needs your attention” and correction-review detour with one clear next setup step.
- Splits readiness into microphone, accessibility, model, shortcut, and first-dictation checks.
- Adds a visible action to every readiness item that opens the exact screen needed.
- Explains how to use the dictation shortcut when setup is complete.
]]></description>
